**command.cpp registers gamepad controller console commands.**

## API

`register_commands(const context& ctx, runtime& rt) -> void` adds `controller_status`, `bindgpbuttonsconfigs`, and `bindgpsticksconfigs`.

## Behavior

`controller_status` reports `device_count()` and `keys().in_use()`; layout commands call `reapply_layout()` or report `sticks_config` via `read(..., "thumbstick_default")`.